# fx/thrust: the Thrust Streak (the spear family's effect, `fx thrust`), P2c SLICE-ARMS 2026-10-23. STYLE_P2 25.10 and 6:
# A3's three-tone construction (A core, B body, C edge; art_fx tints it #E8F0FF > #9FB4D8): two speed lines either side
# of the haft running back from the point, hugging the leaf and thinning to a wisp, and a three-pixel flash past the tip.
# a1 is the impact frame (full length; it holds through the hit-stop beat), a2 the pull (a short fading pair). Drawn on
# the pivot at the strike frame's spear point (the knight's sp_hit grips, the clip's lean and bob) in every facing;
# facing up behind the body. (P2c slice i3) the flash past the point touches the white tip pixel facing right and left (it
# stood 1-2 px clear and read as a second, detached tip). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role fx thrust
layer fx
anchor pivot
keys fx

view D key a1 origin 3 9
|....CC.............
|......CB...........
|........BB.........
|CC........BA.......
|..CB........AA.....
|....BB.............
|......BA...........
|........AA.........
|................B..
|...............BAB.
|................B..
|...................

view D key a2 origin 0 8
|....CC....
|......CB..
|........CB
|CC........
|..CB......
|....CB....

