# (LADDER-ARMS i1) `spark`: the block's impact (STYLE_P2 25.8 item 7, 25.10): a 7 px four-point star in brass light
# and white, high on the raised haft where the blow lands (above the helm's front, never on the face); shown on the block's impact frame only (fx=spark), inside the figure's box plus reach.
